graph TD
    Client[React Frontend / inventory-ui] -->|HTTP / JSON| Gateway[API Gateway: Port 8080]
    
    %% Service Discovery & Config
    Gateway -.->|Resolve Services| Eureka[Eureka Server: Port 8761]
    
    %% Internal Routing
    Gateway --> Auth[Auth Service: Port 8081]
    Gateway --> Product[Product Service: Port 8082]
    Gateway --> Warehouse[Warehouse Service: Port 8083]
    Gateway --> Inventory[Inventory Service: Port 8084]
    Gateway --> Replenish[Replenishment Service: Port 8085]
    Gateway --> Reporting[Reporting Service: Port 8086]
    Gateway --> Notification[Notification Service: Port 8087]
    
    %% Config Server
    Auth -.->|Fetch Config| Config[Config Server: Port 8888]
    Product -.->|Fetch Config| Config
    Warehouse -.->|Fetch Config| Config
    Inventory -.->|Fetch Config| Config
    Replenish -.->|Fetch Config| Config
    Reporting -.->|Fetch Config| Config
    Notification -.->|Fetch Config| Config

    %% Database connections
    Auth & Product & Warehouse & Inventory & Replenish & Reporting -->|JPA / Hibernate| MySQL[(MySQL Database)]

    %% Event Broker
    Inventory -->|Publish: inventory-updated, stock-transferred| Kafka[(Kafka Message Broker)]
    Replenish -->|Publish: purchase-request-created| Kafka
    Kafka -->|Consume Events| Notification
